um/main-category/exalted/6810-exalted-miss-universe?p=6957#post6957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Melinda Bam, Miss South Africa 2012 looks like a Sorceress<br /> <a href=\"http://content.missuniverse.com/media/photos/galleries/photographer_uploaded_1_73_4_1355598909_2012.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://content.missuniverse.com/medi...98909_2012.jpg</a></div> </div> </div> </div>She needs to be in a magic duel with Monic Perez, Miss Puerto Rico 2013<br /> <img src=\"http://wpc.4d27.edgecastcdn.net/004D27/2013/Events/2013MissUniverseNationalCostumes/MissUniverse2013NationalCostumesPART1/Miss+Universe+2013+National+Costumes+Part+1%20%2819%29.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T13:38:56-08:00","id":7009,"title":"","content":"This thread is a million times better than what I would have expected based on the title.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T13:45:10-08:00","id":7014,"title":"","content":"If you feel like it, you could upload the ones you like in the common flickr group I made:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TrueMonk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/5265-exalted-pictures#post5265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So inspired from the [Photoshop] Exaltification! thread, I started looking around for more good exalted pictures. That was nice and all, but I thought we could use someplace to collect all the cool pictures we find/make/exaltify (and I could not find an existing one). Flickr seemed like a good place to do it, so here it is.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/groups/2430709@N22/pool/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/groups/2430709@N22/pool/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/groups/2430709@N22/pool/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.flickr.com/groups/2430709@N22/pool/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I think you have to make an account and sign up to see them.<br /> <br /> If you post a picture in this thread I will try to put it in the group. You are also most welcome to join the group on Flickr and do it yourself :-) But you should probably write and post your picture here too, otherwise this thread will disappear in no time.<br /> <br /> I think it will make it easier for everyone if we use tags, just to sort it a bit at least.<br /> <br /> <br /> (This is the first time I use Flickr, so anyone with, or without, experience are welcome to join in the administration of the group :-) )</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> :-)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Also, look at <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ow3IPUb4QtgMb1y2evMSGlJxE2VmTEOvyhJDu2eMAAo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">the exalted fan collection</a> that we are making.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/80-truemonk","name":"TrueMonk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T13:45:33-08:00","id":7015,"title":"","content":"I agree. However, it has also convinced me that the clothing designers for these competitions are really bizarre - I never expected that someplace so mainstream as Miss Universe would feature outfits that would work for Exalted, or ComicCon. I suspect both groups would be traumatized to realize this fact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.c